# Config & shared resources

## GameConfig

- Schema: `src/common/game_config.gd`
- Default instance: `src/common/game_config_default.tres`
- Groups: Pawn, Shield, Attack, Stun/Flight, Player, Arena, Impulse modifiers
- Battle scenes `@export` the default `.tres` for isolated F6; parents may override later via `ResourceUtils.update_resource`

## Event buses

| Resource | Path | Role |
|----------|------|------|
| `RootEvents` | `src/game/scenes/app_root/root_events.tres` | App navigation |
| `GameEvents` | `src/game/scenes/game/game_events.tres` | In-battle broadcasts |

- One live `.tres` instance shared via `@export` — do not `Resource.new()` parallel buses
- Signals named `ev_*`

## Must

- New tunable → field on `GameConfig` (+ sensible default), not a magic number in a feature
- Bump docs in `concepts/ART_DIRECTION.md` if interaction-table defaults change meaningfully
- Keep `.tres` and `.gd` schema in sync

## Avoid

- Autoload EventBus
- Editing “live” battle config permanently for content that should be defaults only
